  + [prerequisite] is accepted no-live-effect proof route
  + [prerequisite] is accepted generated-output cleanup or ignored-path policy
  + [prerequisite] is explicit list of fixture families opened for materialization
  + [prerequisite] is completion review after every materialization slice

  = must: block fixture materialization when any prerequisite is absent, stale, contradicted, or ambiguous
  = must: require deeper reasoning when materialization scope changes fixture authority or proof ledger semantics

