& [P8MaterializationOutputBoundary] is the output boundary for future fixture materialization
  + [allowed_future_output_after_activation] is fixture_source_file
  + [allowed_future_output_after_activation] is expected_ledger_file
  + [allowed_future_output_after_activation] is generated_output_file
