  + [forbidden_current_output] is any of the above before activation
  + [forbidden_future_output] is source authority created from generated output
  + [forbidden_future_output] is dispatch authority created from fixture success
  + [forbidden_future_output] is operations authority created from dry-run success
  + [forbidden_future_output] is live-control authority created from proof success

  = must: require generated outputs to remain ignored and rebuildable
