& [P8ImplementationActivationBoundary] is the boundary for future P8 implementation activation
  + [activation_may_open] is fixture file creation
  + [activation_may_open] is expected ledger creation
  + [activation_may_open] is generated output creation
  + [activation_may_open] is bounded fixture runner or validation harness updates
  + [activation_may_not_open] is dependency installation unless separately accepted
  + [activation_may_not_open] is adapter implementation
  + [activation_may_not_open] is transport implementation
  + [activation_may_not_open] is UI implementation
  + [activation_may_not_open] is assignment or dispatch
  + [activation_may_not_open] is operations control or live machine control

  = must: require future activation slices to state Spark-suitable or requires deeper reasoning explicitly
  = must: require proof that generated fixture outputs do not touch mailbox IO, network, credentials, process control, GPU control, job dispatch, destructive filesystem actions, operations control, or live machine control

